:: Loc_test_home
TEST CONTENT. A plain placeholder flat where the test storyline starts.

:: Loc_test_neighbour
TEST CONTENT. The house next door, a five-minute walk down the street.

:: Loc_test_high_street
TEST CONTENT. A placeholder high street with a bus stop and a taxi rank.

:: Loc_test_clinic
TEST CONTENT. A placeholder clinic with a small waiting room. A secretary sits at the front desk; the therapist's office is down the corridor.

:: Loc_test_city_centre
TEST CONTENT. A placeholder city centre: busy streets, a bus interchange and a taxi rank.

:: Loc_test_park
TEST CONTENT. A placeholder park at the end of the bus line.

:: Ev_test_secretary_interrupts
<h1>Interrupted</h1>

TEST CONTENT. Halfway through the session there's a knock at the door. The secretary leans in: something urgent needs the therapist's attention. The therapist apologises and ends the session early.

<<view "event-end">>

:: Ev_test_meet_therapist
<h1>Meeting the therapist</h1>

TEST CONTENT. This is the first time you've met the therapist. She introduces herself. (A one-off "story" event, fired by the first encounter.)

<<view "event-end">>

:: Ev_test_bus_breakdown
<h1>Breakdown</h1>

TEST CONTENT. At the City Centre stop the bus shudders and stops for good. Everyone has to get off here.

<<view "event-end">>

:: Test_Therapy [nobr]
<h1>Test: storyline shortcuts</h1>
<p>Shortcuts for testing. They change the game state directly, so only use them in debug mode.</p>
<<if setup.config.debug>>
<h2>Therapy</h2>
<ul>
<li><<button "Go to Test Clinic, next 10:00">><<run setup.testTools.toClinicAt("10:00")>><</button>></li>
<li><<button "Next session: secretary WILL interrupt">><<run setup.events.force("test_secretary_interrupts", true)>><<run setup.flow.go("Here")>><</button>></li>
<li><<button "Next session: secretary WON'T interrupt">><<run setup.events.force("test_secretary_interrupts", false)>><<run setup.flow.go("Here")>><</button>></li>
<li><<button "Back to normal (50% chance)">><<run setup.events.force("test_secretary_interrupts", null)>><<run setup.flow.go("Here")>><</button>></li>
</ul>
<h2>Travel</h2>
<ul>
<li><<button "Bus trips: break down at City Centre">><<run setup.events.force("test_bus_breakdown", true)>><<run setup.flow.go("Here")>><</button>></li>
<li><<button "Bus trips: normal">><<run setup.events.force("test_bus_breakdown", null)>><<run setup.flow.go("Here")>><</button>></li>
</ul>
<</if>>
<p>[[Back to test index|Test_Index]]</p>
